{{#with booking}}
<p class="greeting">Dear <strong>{{#if full_name}}{{full_name}}{{else}}Traveller{{/if}}</strong>,</p>

<p class="lead">
  Thank you for your interest in travelling with <strong>Tanzania Safari Magic</strong>.
  After carefully checking availability for your requested dates, we are sorry to say we cannot confirm this exact booking as submitted.
</p>

<p class="section-label">Request we reviewed</p>
<div class="data-card">
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Booking reference</span>
    <span class="value">#{{booking_reference}}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Safari / package</span>
    <span class="value">{{package_name}}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Requested date</span>
    <span class="value">{{formatDate start_date}}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Status</span>
    <span class="value"><span class="badge badge-error">Unable to confirm as requested</span></span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="info-box warning">
  <strong>This is usually about timing — not about you</strong><br>
  Peak migration weeks, popular lodges, and limited park vehicle slots fill quickly. The good news: we almost always have excellent alternatives — nearby dates, a different lodge style, or a private itinerary that still matches what you hoped to see.
</div>

<p>Please reply to this email or WhatsApp us with flexible date ranges (even ±3–5 days helps). Our consultants will propose clear options with pricing so you can choose with confidence.</p>

<div class="cta-row">
  <a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/255695108009">Discuss alternatives on WhatsApp</a>
  <a class="btn-secondary" href="{{#if site_url}}{{site_url}}{{else}}https://tanzaniasafarimagic.com{{/if}}/booking">Submit new dates</a>
</div>

<p class="closing">We truly hope to host you in Tanzania soon — and we will work hard to make the next option feel even better.</p>
{{/with}}
